  "title": "Create UTF-8-valid strings for protocol tree",
  "description": "Unvalidated input is being passed to `proto_tree_add_string()` and\nfamily resulting in it being assumed UTF-8, failing to parse as such,\nand causing problems. Validate input being passed to these functions\nfrom the HTTP and TDS dissectors.\n\nCloses #18448",
